        <mxCell id="section_gap" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEF2FF;strokeColor=#4F46E5;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;align=center" value="当前状态 -&gt; 剩余核心差距 -&gt; V4.0-E 出门目标" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="52" width="2060" x="70" y="1010" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="current" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EFF6FF;strokeColor=#3B82F6;align=left;spacingLeft=18;fontSize=15" value="当前已完成&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• V3.5：Application Adaptation Layer baseline&lt;br&gt;• V3.6：Workflow Runtime Contract + Dummy Pipeline E2E&lt;br&gt;• V4.0-0/A/A2：UI contract、Workflow Studio shell、真实 BFF read/event bridge&lt;br&gt;• V4.0-B/C：Patch Diff / AgentTalk preparation shell，不静默 apply/publish&lt;br&gt;• V4.0-D：Quality read-only、workflow-bound approval.respond、context.business update、business.event.emit&lt;br&gt;• V4.0-E：Reference Console integration baseline，含 BusinessEventBinding / seeded patch / approval side-effect&lt;br&gt;• 验证：V4.0 tests 47 passed；frontend tests 17 passed；build passed" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="210" width="590" x="100" y="1100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="gap" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#F59E0B;align=left;spacingLeft=18;fontSize=15" value="剩余核心差距&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• 已完成 Reference Console component-level + BFF integration E2E，但尚无 browser-level smoke&lt;br&gt;• 节点拖拽尚未创建 runtime Station；连线尚未写回 WorkflowEdge&lt;br&gt;• Inspector 尚未通过 WorkflowPatch 写回 draft&lt;br&gt;• Patch apply/reject/publish 仍不暴露&lt;br&gt;• Quality create/attach 不在当前 UI；quality.evaluated 仍 trace-only&lt;br&gt;• AgentTalkWindow 仍是 preparation shell，没有完整状态机&lt;br&gt;• 只能声明 integration baseline，不能声明 complete Workflow Studio ready" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="210" width="590" x="805" y="1100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="target" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#059669;align=left;spacingLeft=18;fontSize=15" value="V4.0-E 已达成&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Reference workflow console 使用平台中立 workflow&lt;br&gt;• UI 默认只走 /bff/* structured routes&lt;br&gt;• Board / status / output / artifact / approval / quality / context / event 全链路跑通&lt;br&gt;• BusinessEventBinding、seeded patch diff、approval side-effect 均来自 V3.6 runtime fixture&lt;br&gt;• EventBridge 只触发 refresh，不自建 runtime truth&lt;br&gt;• 当前声明：dev/local Workflow Console integration baseline ready" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="210" width="590" x="1510" y="1100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="eg1" edge="1" parent="1" source="current" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#0284C7;endArrow=block;endFill=1" target="gap">
