        <mxCell id="summary_now" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEF2FF;strokeColor=#4F46E5;align=left;spacingLeft=18;fontSize=15" value="当前开发阶段&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;V4.0-E complete at integration baseline&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;已落地：&lt;br&gt;• Reference fixture：template/version/instance/station/job/artifact/approval/quality/context&lt;br&gt;• BusinessEventBinding：business.video.scene.selected -&gt; context.business.selected_scene&lt;br&gt;• Seeded PatchDiffDTO：来自 V3.6 patch repository&lt;br&gt;• approval.respond side-effect：刷新后 workflow/station 继续&lt;br&gt;• EventBridge refresh truth + DTO redaction&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;验证：V4.0 47 passed；frontend 17 passed + build passed" vertex="1">
