        <mxCell id="p0_list" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#059669;align=left;spacingLeft=16;fontSize=14" value="V4.0-E Gate Checks&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Reference workflow console 使用平台中立 workflow&lt;br&gt;2. UI 默认只调用 /bff/* structured routes&lt;br&gt;3. BFF 通过 SDK/RPC 访问 V3.6 runtime&lt;br&gt;4. Board/status/output/artifact/approval/quality/context/event 全链路跑通&lt;br&gt;5. BusinessEventBinding、seeded patch diff、approval side-effect 有 runtime fixture 证据&lt;br&gt;6. scope isolation、redaction、EventBridge refresh 和 operation panels 有测试证据" vertex="1">
